B.a6I=s(["Maintain TABC.","Respiratory support: Nasal prong O\u2082 if SpO\u2082 <91% (titrate to 91\u201395%); nasal CPAP if respiratory distress; intubate if gasping or poor effort.","Check blood glucose; send CBC and electrolytes.","If sepsis is likely, draw blood culture and give the first antibiotic dose without delay.","Start IV fluids as per weight and postnatal age.","Manage shock, dehydration and seizures."],t.s)
