B.r0=s(["Laser photocoagulation and/or intravitreal anti-VEGF injection, as decided by the ROP specialist based on zone and disease characteristics.","Vitreo-retinal surgery for advanced ROP.","Treatment-requiring ROP should be treated urgently, preferably within 48\u201372 hours of the decision to treat."],t.s)
