B.a3k=s(["Triage classification documented (%): neonates with a documented triage category at initial assessment \xf7 all neonates assessed \xd7 100.","Complete triage measurements (%): sick neonates with temperature, SpO\u2082 AND blood glucose recorded at initial assessment \xf7 all sick neonates assessed \xd7 100."],t.s)
B.a24=s(["Triage every neonate on arrival \u2014 treat emergency signs immediately and assess priority signs promptly."],t.s)
