B.a2u=s(["Diarrhoeal severe dehydration: IV RL/NS 30 mL/kg in 1 h, then 70 mL/kg over 5 h (WHO Plan C).","If IV not possible: ORS 20 mL/kg/h for 6 h. Assess 1\u20132 hourly and titrate fluids.","Hypernatremic dehydration related to poor feeding/hot environment: manage as per the standard neonatal protocol."],t.s)
B.Xk=new A.b1(B.bI,B.aP,"Severe dehydration",B.a2u,B.p)
B.a2H=s(["Screen every neonate immediately on arrival for emergency and priority signs.","Maintain TABC, assess SpO\u2082 and blood glucose, and start indicated treatment promptly. Reassess after each intervention.","Administer the first dose of antibiotic within 1 hour if there is a high likelihood of sepsis."],t.s)
