B.a8g=s(["Maintain TABC.","Nasal prong oxygen if SpO\u2082 <91%.","Check blood glucose and act accordingly.","Start IV fluids (if abdominal distension/GI malformation) or gavage feeds.","Assess the risk factors for sepsis.","Investigations as per clinical findings."],t.s)
